            <ArticleTitle>A one-day couple group intervention to enhance sexual recovery for surgically treated men with prostate cancer and their partners: a pilot study.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>140-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Researchers evaluated the acceptance and effectiveness of a group intervention that provided education about post-prostatectomy sexual recovery and peer support for couples. Couples valued the intervention and retained the information. Partners became accepting of erectile dysfunction and communicated more openly about upsetting topics.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
